Two things worth watching once this is running. First, whether `←` traces survive contact with real brain dumps or bloat the contract past usefulness — if they bloat, the fix is shortening the span, never dropping it. Second, `unclassified` volume as the drift canary; if it climbs above roughly a fifth of contract content on realistic inputs, D.5 is too permissive and slot definitions need widening rather than the escape hatch absorbing more.

